{"2321690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Voyager", "steam_appid": 2321690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>The Voyager</strong> you play a solitary inventor who has dedicated his life to breaking the laws of physics. You built the Device, but you never imagined what lay on the other side. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/14f5e6f6c1414c590fe8dcc0888c8cee.poster.avif?t=1782021902\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/14f5e6f6c1414c590fe8dcc0888c8cee.webm?t=1782021902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/14f5e6f6c1414c590fe8dcc0888c8cee.mp4?t=1782021902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dimensions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the mind of the protagonist in his daily routine, work on the device and play the video game, go to sleep and see what the subconscious tells you from your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel to parallel worlds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't know the destination and you don't know the duration of the journey but it's the same land, the same year and the same day, something different has happened in evolution.. Cross desolate dimensions, mysterious islands inhabited by prehistoric creatures and military bases. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/a554aadbd52507a155966fec399bd487.poster.avif?t=1782021902\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/a554aadbd52507a155966fec399bd487.webm?t=1782021902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/a554aadbd52507a155966fec399bd487.mp4?t=1782021902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world is a piece of the puzzle to understand the Krag threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/c78bf92582b6c9015babb9143603ca16.poster.avif?t=1782021902\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/c78bf92582b6c9015babb9143603ca16.webm?t=1782021902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/c78bf92582b6c9015babb9143603ca16.mp4?t=1782021902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is a linear narrative experience where you advance the story by overcoming small environmental challenges, with some horror, FPS, stealth and simple puzzle sections. Between trips, return to the safety of your home, drink coffee, train, upgrade your device and note your discoveries in the journal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/0dea78e17910179082675d673716d57a.poster.avif?t=1782021902\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/0dea78e17910179082675d673716d57a.webm?t=1782021902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/0dea78e17910179082675d673716d57a.mp4?t=1782021902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Horror of the Unknown</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dreams reflect the trauma of your travels. Confront psychological manifestations of your guilt and terror in dream sequences that change as the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/5e324127da266d6ade32f2ad045d4908.poster.avif?t=1782021902\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/5e324127da266d6ade32f2ad045d4908.webm?t=1782021902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/5e324127da266d6ade32f2ad045d4908.mp4?t=1782021902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Terrible Threat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A race is crossing dimensions… and you're in the middle. Discover the truth about the Krags, they are not aliens but they are not human either... but they will stop at nothing to conquer all the parallel worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/86db09289b07d66e607d89af1f614c6b.poster.avif?t=1782021902\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/86db09289b07d66e607d89af1f614c6b.webm?t=1782021902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321690/extras/86db09289b07d66e607d89af1f614c6b.mp4?t=17820219